},{"text":"AI-for-Science Researcher"},{"text":"R&D Programme Lead"},{"text":"Research Director"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Applied Physics","Photonics/Instrumentation","Experimental Research","Scientific Computing","AI/Data Analysis"],"sep":"+"}]}]}